    "body": "Closes #77.\n\nConnects the three navigation buttons (back, forward, reload) to their respective handlers.\n\n## Behavior\n- Reload: if a URL is saved in m_current_url, refill the URL bar and re-trigger the fetch (validation + fetch)\n- Back: shows a placeholder message (real history is a future task)\n- Forward: shows a placeholder message (real history is a future task)\n- Reload without a saved URL: shows a short message\n\n## Changes\n- src/browser/window.hpp: add three handlers (on_back_clicked, on_forward_clicked, on_reload_clicked) and m_current_url member\n- src/browser/window.cpp: enable the three buttons, connect signal_clicked to each handler, implement the three handlers, save the current URL after a successful fetch\n\nAll handlers use the same signal -> handler -> logic -> update UI pattern established in #61.\n\n## Verified manually\n- Reload works: refills URL bar and fetches again\n- Back shows the placeholder message\n- Forward shows the placeholder message\n- Reload without a saved URL shows the appropriate message",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-30T06:29:30Z",
